       CALL-ZEN01KT3-001.
               CALL 'ZEN01KT3' USING DFHCOMMAREA
                         WS-STATUS-CODE.
               IF WS-RESP NOT = DFHRESP(NORMAL)
                  MOVE ' LINK ZEN01KT3 FAILED' TO EM-VARIABLE
